          "body": "Parked awaiting CI on new head: PR #882 unit tests (linux+windows) failed on a7f7e2d37a because the mocked `interval: 0` now legitimately delays the first token poll ~8s (5s fallback + 3s margin), past the tests' ~1s `eventually` window — the same point Codex's P2 finding raised. Fixed in 60f64424c4 (explicit 20000-iteration wait budget at both device-authorization test sites, mocks unchanged); Codex and CodeRabbit threads answered. Resume: read PR #882 checks fresh for 60f64424c4; if green and findings dispositioned, merge (merge commit), confirm this issue closed, clean queue labels, complete task 3471.\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=repo-queue-worker-shift-opencode lane=A task=3471 state=parked reason=ci-in-progress -->",
